{"id": "2091429", "name": "קבוצות – חיתוך קטעים וקרניים", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "none", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"width: 100%; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color: #1f2937; line-height: 1.65; text-align: right;\" title=\"BGU_STACK_Q1_SETS_V1\">\n<div style=\"background: #F4F1F5; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 14px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f; margin-bottom: 8px;\">חיתוך של קרניים וקטע</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 18px; line-height: 2;\">\\(A={{CT:0}}\\)<br>\\(B={{CT:1}}\\)<br>\\(S={{CT:2}}\\)</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 14px;\">\n<div style=\"font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f; margin-bottom: 10px;\">התשובה</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center; color: #665f6b; font-size: 13px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">לכתיבת קטע השתמשו ב־oo(a,b), co(a,b), oc(a,b), cc(a,b). אפשר להשתמש ב־minf וב־inf.</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\\(\\displaystyle A\\cap B\\cap S=\\) [[input:ans1]]</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center; color: #665f6b; font-size: 13px;\">[[validation:ans1]]</div>\n</div>\n</div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"width: 100%; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color: #1f2937; line-height: 1.65; text-align: right;\" title=\"BGU_STACK_Q1_SETS_V1\">\n<div style=\"background: #F4F1F5; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 14px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f;\">פתרון מלא</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 14px;\">\n<p>בחיתוך של קטעים וקרניים, הקצה השמאלי של התוצאה הוא הגדול מבין הקצוות השמאליים הרלוונטיים, והקצה הימני הוא הקטן מבין הקצוות הימניים.</p>\n<p>כאן מתקבלים הקצוות</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 17px;\">\\(\\displaystyle \\ell=\\max({{CT:3}},{{CT:4}})={{CT:5}},\\qquad r=\\min({{CT:6}},{{CT:7}})={{CT:8}}\\)</div>\n<p>לאחר מכן בודקים האם כל אחד משני הקצוות נכלל <strong>בכל</strong> הקבוצות שמכתיבות אותו. כך נקבע אם הסוגר בקצה פתוח או סגור.</p>\n<p>לכן</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold;\">\\(\\displaystyle A\\cap B\\cap S={{CT:9}}\\)</div>\n</div>\n</div>", "specificfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">\n<div>[[feedback:prt1]]</div>\n</div>", "prtcorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"correct\">תשובה נכונה.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"partially\">התשובה נכונה חלקית.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"incorrect\">התשובה אינה נכונה.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 32, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 3, "syntaxhint": "למשל: co(-1,3)", "syntaxattribute": 1, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "correct:if equal(ta,ans1) then true else false; closedwrong:if equal(taClosed,ans1) then true else false; openwrong:if equal(taOpen,ans1) then true else false;", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "correct", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "closedwrong", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0.5, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-2-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "prt1-2-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 2, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "openwrong", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0.5, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-3-T", "feedback": "<p dir=\"rtl\">הקצוות המספריים נכונים, אך סימנת את שני הקצוות כפתוחים.</p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-3-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["A", "Atemp", "B", "S", "hi", "lc", "lo", "mode", "p", "q", "rc", "sL", "sR", "slc", "src", "ta", "taClosed", "taOpen"], "nvariants": 50}